'''Jal-AkRek-Xil''' is a [[volcanic creature]] encountered in the [[Inferno]]. It appears when a [[Jal-Ak]] has been killed, alongside a [[Jal-AkRek-Mej]] and [[Jal-AkRek-Ket]]. They have an attack distance of 15 tiles.

